#
# ADORE secrets template. Copy to .env (gitignored) and fill in.
# Non-secret settings belong in config.toml, never here.

# --- Host forge authentication ------------------------------------------------
# Authenticate `glab`, `gh` or `tea` on the host that runs ADORE. Do not place forge
# credentials here: ADORE invokes the authenticated host CLI for forge access.

# --- Executor model provider ---------------------------------------------------
# Pi receives the configured provider's key automatically. executor.env_keys
# lists only additional permitted secret variables. Never bake keys into an image.
# ChatGPT subscriptions use the server sign-in instead of a provider API key.
#ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
#OPENAI_API_KEY=
